            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Here I revisit our early experiments published in Cell Host &amp; Microbe (Turnbaugh et al., 2008) showing that a diet rich in fat and simple sugars alters the gut microbiome in a manner that contributes to host adiposity, and reflect upon the remarkable advances and remaining challenges in this field.</AbstractText>
